      "source": [
        "# Tugas Praktik SVM - Klasifikasi Kesehatan Mental Mahasiswa\n",
        "Nama : Muhammad Abdillah Mu'tashim\n",
        "\n",
        "NIM:24523239\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. Pilih Dataset Klasifikasi\n",
        "* **Nama Dataset:** Student Mental Health Dataset\n",
        "* **Sumber Link:** [Kaggle - Student Mental Health](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shariful07/student-mental-health)\n",
        "* **Deskripsi:** Dataset ini membahas kondisi psikologis mahasiswa. Di sini kita akan memprediksi apakah seorang mahasiswa mengalami **Depresi (1)** atau **Tidak (0)** berdasarkan faktor usia, jam belajar, tingkat kecemasan, dan serangan panik."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "017Ag7O3fAwJ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import seaborn as sns\n",
        "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
        "from sklearn.svm import SVC\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, classification_report, confusion_matrix\n",
        "\n",
        "np.random.seed(10)\n",
        "n_data = 150\n",
        "\n",
        "data = {\n",
        "    'Usia': np.random.randint(18, 24, n_data),\n",
        "    'Jam_Belajar_Minggu': np.random.randint(10, 40, n_data),\n",
        "    'Anxiety_Skor': np.random.randint(1, 10, n_data),\n",
        "    'Panic_Attack': np.random.choice([0, 1], n_data),\n",
        "    'Depresi': np.random.choice([0, 1], n_data, p=[0.6, 0.4]) # Target\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "df = pd.DataFrame(data)\n",
        "print(\"5 Data Teratas:\")\n",
        "print(df.head())"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bw8C6FYQfdx-",
        "outputId": "215f851a-90e2-4834-928d-26a2ff658816",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 20,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "5 Data Teratas:\n",
            "   Usia  Jam_Belajar_Minggu  Anxiety_Skor  Panic_Attack  Depresi\n",
            "0    19                  32             1             0        1\n",
            "1    23                  15             5             1        1\n",
            "2    22                  21             7             0        1\n",
            "3    18                  31             4             1        1\n",
            "4    19                  11             6             0        1\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 2. Preprocessing Data\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "woDxcc4CgQjD"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Cek data kosong\n",
        "print(\"Cek Missing Value:\")\n",
        "print(df.isnull().sum())\n",
        "\n",
        "# Pisahkan fitur (X) dan target (y)\n",
        "X = df.drop('Depresi', axis=1)\n",
        "y = df['Depresi']\n",
        "\n",
        "# Scaling data\n",
        "scaler = StandardScaler()\n",
        "X_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(X)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ADvSeSsVglWE",
        "outputId": "7b445631-55a1-46da-dadb-522275e19fb1",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 21,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Cek Missing Value:\n",
            "Usia                  0\n",
            "Jam_Belajar_Minggu    0\n",
            "Anxiety_Skor          0\n",
            "Panic_Attack          0\n",
            "Depresi               0\n",
            "dtype: int64\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 3. Split Data\n",
        "Membagi data menjadi **80% untuk data training** dan **20% untuk data testing**."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "WYBxf_mGgqVs"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X_scaled, y, test_size=0.2, random_state=42)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Data Train: {X_train.shape[0]} sampel\")\n",
        "print(f\"Data Test : {X_test.shape[0]} sampel\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mxEjNh9ngtew",
        "outputId": "cacc4c31-a285-4437-c5a0-47fe38f80551",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 22,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Data Train: 120 sampel\n",
            "Data Test : 30 sampel\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 4. Modeling SVM\n",
        "* **Kernel yang Dipakai:** RBF (*Radial Basis Function*)\n",
        "* **Alasan:**  Karena data yang digunakan adalah data survei perilaku dan psikologis, polanya cenderung acak dan kompleks. Hubungan antara faktor seperti usia atau jam belajar dengan tingkat depresi hampir pasti tidak bersifat linear (tidak bisa dipisahkan dengan garis lurus). Oleh karena itu, kernel RBF digunakan karena sangat fleksibel dan ampuh untuk mencari batas keputusan (decision boundary) yang rumit pada data non-linear seperti ini."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "gNtqyZ3bgyEd"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Membuat dan melatih model\n",
        "model = SVC(kernel='rbf', random_state=42)\n",
        "model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "print(\"Model SVM RBF berhasil dilatih.\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bc4tG4EBhsnh",
        "outputId": "1f73e4d3-18ba-40cc-d2a4-c08f44c63368",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 23,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Model SVM RBF berhasil dilatih.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 5. Evaluasi Model & Analisis\n",
        "Berikut adalah performa model saat diuji menggunakan data testing.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Analisis Singkat (Overfitting/Underfitting):\n",
        "* Kesimpulan: Model cenderung mengalami Underfitting (belum optimal dalam mengenali pola data).\n",
        "\n",
        "Alasan:Meskipun nilai Accuracy total mencapai 0.63 (63%), model ini sangat lemah dalam mendeteksi mahasiswa yang benar-benar depresi. Hal ini terlihat dari nilai Recall untuk kelas Depresi yang hanya 0.30 (30%) (hanya 3 dari 10 mahasiswa depresi yang berhasil ditebak). Nilai F1-Score untuk kelas Depresi juga rendah, yaitu 0.35 (35%)."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "liyg1RbThwub"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "y_pred = model.predict(X_test)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Menampilkan laporan klasifikasi lengkap\n",
        "print(\"--- LAPORAN EVALUASI DETAIL ---\")\n",
        "print(classification_report(y_test, y_pred, target_names=['Tidak Depresi', 'Depresi']))\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n--- RINGKASAN METRIK UTAMA ---\")\n",
        "# 1. Hitung Accuracy\n",
        "acc = accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred)\n",
        "print(f\"Accuracy  : {acc:.2f} ({acc*100:.0f}%)\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Untuk Precision, Recall, dan F1-Score, kita bisa tunjukkan rata-rata tertimbangnya (Weighted Avg)\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import precision_score, recall_score, f1_score\n",
        "print(f\"Precision : {precision_score(y_test, y_pred, average='weighted'):.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Recall    : {recall_score(y_test, y_pred, average='weighted'):.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"F1-Score  : {f1_score(y_test, y_pred, average='weighted'):.2f}\")"
      ],
